# {{ app.name }}

A PathOps Application created from the `generic-container` Golden Path.

This repository is yours: change anything, including `.pathops/`.

```text
app/              the application: a static page (replace it with your own)
tests/            source/component tests (run without a deployment)
.pathops/build/   how the application image is built (Dockerfile and build files)
```

The image is built with the repository root as context:

```bash
sh tests/check-content.sh
docker build -f .pathops/build/Dockerfile -t {{ app.name }}:local .
docker run --rm -p 8080:8080 {{ app.name }}:local   # http://localhost:8080
```

The deployed environments live in two other repositories, each with its own
desired state and checks: `{{ app.name }}-gitops-preflight` and
`{{ app.name }}-gitops-production`.
